WEBVTT

00:48:28.276 --> 00:48:30.436
on their accounts.

00:48:30.436 --> 00:48:33.276
And another thing,
so many people in Israel,

00:48:33.316 --> 00:48:35.716
they came from the former Soviet Union.

00:48:36.076 --> 00:48:37.676
And until now,

00:48:37.716 --> 00:48:40.316
everybody was simply known as Russians.

00:48:40.676 --> 00:48:44.996
You know, even if you came from Azerbaijan
or you came from Bukhara,

00:48:45.036 --> 00:48:46.236
you were a Russian.

00:48:46.956 --> 00:48:48.636
And suddenly, "No, no, no, no, no.

00:48:48.636 --> 00:48:49.796
I'm not Russian.

00:48:49.836 --> 00:48:51.316
I'm Ukrainian."

00:48:51.916 --> 00:48:57.436
And again, these seeds of hatred
that Putin is planting,

00:48:57.436 --> 00:49:00.076
it's reaching also here.